        {
          "text": "Isu de Daudi ovu di dezaru azini ovu o’du be fudri ci ’bo, eri ’ba i mvi Sulemanini opiru Israeli ma drilia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.1",
