        {
          "text": "mikate ecetaruri pisi indi, anya­fura inikiniru edeta edele anyafura­sirini pie, mikate edele pekepekeruri pie, mikate ’bani a’dile sufuria aliari pie, a’dile yisiri pie, ka ovu o’bizaru afa o’biza ngonisi kani ovu ngopi ti. ",
